      "summaries": {
        "en": "OpenClaw is a personal AI assistant framework that addresses privacy concerns by enabling users to run AI locally without cloud dependency. It's built with TypeScript for cross-platform compatibility, allowing deployment on any operating system through containerization. Developers can extend its modular architecture to create custom assistants, integrate local models, or build specialized tools while maintaining full data ownership and control over their AI environment.",
        "zh": "OpenClaw是一个开源的个人AI助手框架，核心解决用户对数据隐私和自主控制的需求，让AI助手能在本地运行而无需依赖云端服务。该项目采用TypeScript开发，通过容器化技术实现跨平台部署，可在任何操作系统上使用。其模块化架构允许开发者轻松扩展功能，例如集成本地AI模型、创建定制化工具或构建特定领域的助手应用，为想要完全掌控自己AI环境的用户提供了灵活的技术基础。",
        "es": "OpenClaw is a personal AI assistant framework that addresses privacy concerns by enabling users to run AI locally without cloud dependency. It's built with TypeScript for cross-platform compatibility, allowing deployment on any operating system through containerization. Developers can extend its modular architecture to create custom assistants, integrate local models, or build specialized tools while maintaining full data ownership and control over their AI environment.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "openclaw stands out for ai, assistant, and crustacean in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "OpenClaw is a personal AI assistant framework that addresses privacy concerns by enabling users to run AI locally without cloud dependency. It's built with TypeScript for cross-platform compatibility, allowing deployment on any operating system through containerization. Developers can extend its modular architecture to create custom assistants, integrate local models, or build specialized tools while maintaining full data ownership and control over their AI environment.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
