      "summaries": {
        "en": "Prompts.chat is an open-source platform that solves the challenge of effectively communicating with large language models by providing a curated collection of community-shared prompts. It demonstrates how structured prompt engineering can significantly improve AI responses through techniques like role-playing and task decomposition. Developers can use it as a reference library to learn prompt patterns, integrate prompts into their applications via its API, or self-host the platform to create private prompt repositories for organizational use.",
        "zh": "Prompts.chat 是一个开源平台，旨在解决用户与大型语言模型有效沟通的难题，通过社区共享的精选提示词集合，帮助用户获得更精准的AI回复。其核心价值在于展示了如何通过角色扮演、任务分解等结构化提示工程技术，显著提升模型输出质量。用户可将其作为学习提示词设计的参考库，通过API将优质提示集成到自己的应用中，或自行部署平台以创建组织内部的私有提示库，实现定制化AI交互。",
        "es": "Prompts.chat is an open-source platform that solves the challenge of effectively communicating with large language models by providing a curated collection of community-shared prompts. It demonstrates how structured prompt engineering can significantly improve AI responses through techniques like role-playing and task decomposition. Developers can use it as a reference library to learn prompt patterns, integrate prompts into their applications via its API, or self-host the platform to create private prompt repositories for organizational use.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "prompts.chat stands out for ai, artificial-intelligence, and awesome-list in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Prompts.chat is an open-source platform that solves the challenge of effectively communicating with large language models by providing a curated collection of community-shared prompts. It demonstrates how structured prompt engineering can significantly improve AI responses through techniques like role-playing and task decomposition. Developers can use it as a reference library to learn prompt patterns, integrate prompts into their applications via its API, or self-host the platform to create private prompt repositories for organizational use.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/f/prompts.chat for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
